  "description": "Soundvision SLIM-300G - Slim Series LCR speaker, (6) 3.5 inch glass fiber woofers<br>\r\n<br>\r\nIs this the best soundbar on the market? Yes. It's the thinnest at a mere 2.2\" depth. It has the largest, most powerful drivers in its class - (6) 3.5\", long-throw, glass fiber woofers and (3) 1\" aluminum tweeters.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe SLIM-300 utilizes a 100% extruded aluminum enclosure and can mount against a wall with zero-gap or utilize the display stand (SLIM-STAND, sold separately) for surface mounting.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSolid, one-piece, extruded aluminum enclosure<br>\r\nRigid, long-throw glass fiber cones and ported motor assemblies<br>\r\nEasy wall mounting brackets that do not add to the thickness<br>\r\nCan be mounted vertically or horizontally on the wall<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSpecifications<br>\r\n<br>\r\nType: Low profile 3 in 1 soundbar<br>\r\nWoofer: (6) 3.5\" black glass fiber<br>\r\nTweeter: (3) 1\" aluminum dome<br>\r\nPower: 75 Watts (per ch)<br>\r\nImpedance: 8 ohms<br>\r\nFreq Response: 100 - 20k Hz (+/-3 dB)<br>\r\nSensitivity: 90 dB<br>\r\nGrill Type: Cloth<br>\r\nDimensions: 1066mm x 150mm x 56mm",
